  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      476.99,
      286.69,
      541.05
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      540.35,
      286.62,
      667.79
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired : Allotment of Lot No. 01 in Total Extent of about 0.0503 Hectare, depicted in Suppliment No. 05, Sheet No. 01, Cadastral Map No. 830521, dated 25.12.2024 prepared by the Senior-Superintendent of Surveys of Hambantota District on behalf of the Surveyor General, situated in the Village of Badiganthota in the Grama Niladhari Division of Badiganthota in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Sooriyawewa in Hambantota District, in Sourthern Province :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      667.45,
      286.6,
      720.83
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Badiganthota Kele; Description : Garden, contains a mixed cultivation; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Issued Title Deed No. Ham/Soori/",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
