      572.97
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Divisional Secretariat of Sooriyawewa on the 10th June 2025 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 03rd June 2025, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
